534→
535→Preserves `Falcon<Shake256Hash>` for standard Falcon, adds `Falcon<PoseidonHash>` for Starknet.
536→
537→### New Rust Modules Summary
538→
539→| Module | Purpose | Key dependency |
540→|--------|---------|---------------|
541→| `poseidon_hash.rs` | Poseidon XOF hash_to_point | `lambdaworks-crypto` |
542→| `hints.rs` | Generate FalconVerificationHint | existing NTT/INTT |
543→| `packing.rs` | Base-Q pack/unpack 512 Zq → 29 felt252 | `lambdaworks-math` |
